{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yooka-Replaylee is the definitive remade and enhanced version of the 3D indie platforming collectathon darling, Yooka-Laylee (2017), developed by key creative talent behind the Banjo-Kazooie and Donkey Kong Country games. This demo offers a brand-new experience, guiding the player through the completely redone beginning portion of the game that never existed in the original release. Players will also be able to get taste of the brand-new arcade levels, playing as their favourite pixelated dinosaur, Rextro!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover and explore the new cave levels taking the buddy-duo from Shipwreck Creek all the way to the Hivory Towers led by the corporate creep Capital B. Learn how Yooka and Laylee came into the possession of the most powerful book in the universe and how the search for the magical Pagies begun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Yooka-Replaylee demo will offer fans of the franchise a brand-new Yooka-Laylee experience while giving new fans of the series a tutorialised first taste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Save data from your demo playthrough will transfer into the main game!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3730150?t=1748041152","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730150/7a45600f15df9b05d951b38002fde61ad1a3f481/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748041152","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730150/482e423b38843466f1128015b8856ae94b34a0e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748041152","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730150/482e423b38843466f1128015b8856ae94b34a0e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748041152","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yooka-Replaylee is the definitive remade and enhanced version of the 3D indie platforming collectathon darling, Yooka-Laylee (2017), developed by key creative talent behind the Banjo-Kazooie and Donkey Kong Country games. This demo offers a brand-new experience, guiding the player through the completely redone beginning portion of the game that never existed in the original release. Players will also be able to get taste of the brand-new arcade levels, playing as their favourite pixelated dinosaur, Rextro!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover and explore the new cave levels taking the buddy-duo from Shipwreck Creek all the way to the Hivory Towers led by the corporate creep Capital B. Learn how Yooka and Laylee came into the possession of the most powerful book in the universe and how the search for the magical Pagies begun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Yooka-Replaylee demo will offer fans of the franchise a brand-new Yooka-Laylee experience while giving new fans of the series a tutorialised first taste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Save data from your demo playthrough will transfer into the main game!</i></p>","developers":["Playtonic Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2448020","name":"Yooka-Replaylee"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730150/5029e90c921ab3424d1baf6c96ffa6e92806a1c0/header.jpg?t=1748041152","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Developed by Playtonic Ltd., published by PM Studios, Inc.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended: